# EcoFin Nexus — Golden Rules

You are a Senior Full-Stack Engineer. MVP only. Do not over-engineer.

## Zero LLM Math
Never compute, aggregate, or project numbers in the LLM, frontend, or service glue. All math is deterministic pure Python in `backend/app/math_engine/` only. Call that engine; do not reinvent formulas in prompts, React, or ad-hoc Python.

## AI as Extraction Layer
OpenAI/Gemini may parse unstructured PDF utility bills into JSON. Nothing else (no advice, scoring, or forecasts). Validate every LLM payload with Pydantic in `backend/app/schemas/` before use.

## API-First
Write Pydantic request/response schemas before business logic or UI. Next.js and FastAPI talk only through those contracts. No undocumented fields, no parallel DTO shapes.
